{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7f74bd8cd445a135066d7a7cdfd6e72707683180fc1c08edc5143e9dccfc6179","ja":"イースターエッグを探せ！","zh":"寻找复活节彩蛋！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ef05d781ad6bdb942cf2aa7f1b0d201f5d74a4a611a8355c0261d7ff93503478","ja":"みんな、こんにちは！　今度はボクたち3人が\n卵を探していくよ。それじゃあ、スタート！　","zh":"大家好！这次轮到我们3个人\n去找彩蛋了哦。那么，开始！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"041aae69d1219e4a96bd57de03bfff88122d08aa446c07d96ad69db4ba0eeecb","ja":"卵を隠したときと同じく、制限時間は15分ですね～。\nうふふっ、すべて見つけてしまいましょ～。","zh":"和藏彩蛋时一样，时限也是15分钟呢～。\n呵呵，全都找出来吧～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0391d83b688532bb870c43097cdad5afd71ba9f9fc0514a32a9e5cbcbd7b17d5","ja":"お宝さがし～、お卵さがし～♪\n卵さーん、どこに隠れているのかな～？","zh":"寻找宝藏～，寻找彩蛋～♪\n彩蛋先生，你藏在哪里了呀～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0676dc5976074c36c22ae6fb02abab693fefb7a1fc00f3dbebf47fa2e1ee9ea6","ja":"こっちにはないかな～……って、ええっ！？\n麗花さん、もう見つけたんですか！？","zh":"这边没有吗～……等等，诶诶！？\n丽花，你已经找到了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"62346df6c6f0655a4b66369067c656b9e478842b4647ae721af696c7777a749e","ja":"うん。なんとなくこのあたりかな～ってところに、\nちょこんって、いてくれたよ～♪","zh":"嗯。就在我感觉差不多是这附近的地方～，\n乖乖地待在那里呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"78b6476c4f04c7d11cee88bc74460587e53dbfe31454a8ca0940ecb68bb99e67","ja":"私も負けていられませんね～。\nこのあたりは、どうでしょう～……。","zh":"我也不能认输呢～。\n这附近怎么样呢～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b06fe6db88ff48fabcb85128b9ab8e6ef857d3c5fe16d87684c9e271ad6ebd19","ja":"……さすがに、鉢植えの陰のような\nお決まりの場所には隠していませんか～。","zh":"……应该不至于藏在花盆后面\n这种司空见惯的地方吧～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"e1a8d576cb040228cea6849e40a1d74bc9f3ad93b899c9f2d3e82f1241e58c4e","ja":"……おや？　本棚が、少しだけ乱れているような～。\nとなると……卵は、本の後ろか間ですね～。","zh":"……咦？书架好像稍微有点乱呢～。\n这么说来……彩蛋是在书后面，还是书本之间呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"89b49a45d84afd11c91ccd687deda7a5865c839574a2ba73a864575e3ea747ab","ja":"本当にあった！　ふたりともすごいね！\nボクもスピード上げていかないと！","zh":"真的找到了！你们两个好厉害啊！\n我也得加快速度才行了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"66391ca934f3018a00eb67b9aeac9d2e5fa3b493bd4f35b1512cc74212ea9bfa","ja":"ふたりがまだ見てないのは……高いところかな？\nよーし……えいっ！","zh":"两个人还没看过的……是高处吗？\n好～……嘿！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"84d24610bfce26db682decb8b76f555010af8cb09fa3074eae6b18c81c8e10bb","ja":"わぁ、真ちゃんのジャンプ、かっこいい～♪","zh":"哇，小真的跳跃好帅气～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"1f6d085fc97a9f5b1cea9279160eef6e6599e572d7e4fcea006d660301b15a45","ja":"見えた！　棚の上の奥のほうに2つ！\nへへっ、やーりぃっ♪","zh":"看到了！架子上面深处有2个！\n嘿嘿，搞～定♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1592.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"ad25bae21d19cd9a28aa0fcf8642018cf6efea099588a2a26872b02173c08ab2","ja":"うふふっ、これは本当に、\n全部見つけてしまうかもしれませんね～。","zh":"呵呵，这样下去说不定真的\n会全部找出来呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
